--TEST--
a cursor still inside the receiver of an access is writing a variable, so it is offered the variables in scope and not the members of the class it stands on, `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User { public string $name; }
var $user = new User();
echo $<|>u->name;
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
$user   variable  User
